:m frm object provides methods to control form behavior in JavaScript.
**Set values**:
```javascript
frm.set_value('amount', 1000);
```
**Field properties**:
```javascript
frm.set_df_property('field', 'read_only', 1);
// Read-only
frm.set_df_property('field', 'hidden', 1);
// Hide
frm.set_df_property('field', 'reqd', 1);
