});
// Pseudocode event flow:
// User opens form:
//
→ onload event fires
//
→ refresh event fires
//
→ form rendered
//
// User changes field:
//
→ field change event fires
//
→ refresh event fires
//
→ UI updates
//
// User clicks save:
//
→ validate event fires
//
→ if valid: before_save fires
//
→ save to server
//
→ after_save fires
//
→ refresh event fires
// Common operations:
