description:
:m Excalidraw is split into two parts: the library (@excalidraw/excalidraw) provides the core drawing functionality, and the app (excalidraw-app) adds collaboration, storage, and hosting features. This separation allows developers to embed just the drawing component in their own apps without the backend dependencies. The library is framework-agnostic React component, while the app is a full Next.js/Firebase application.
```typescript
// LIBRARY: @excalidraw/excalidraw
// packages/excalidraw/index.tsx
